# T-152-012 Execution Plan

## Task
Audit Nervous System 11 detectors — registry, config, reserve status, trigger history, NOTIFY output.

## Approach (READ-ONLY)
1. Read `src/nervous/detector-registry.ts` — enumerate registered detectors
2. Read `src/nervous/detectors/*.ts` — verify each detector implementation exists
3. Read `.deckent/config.json` `nervous_system.detectors` — enabled/disabled status
4. Search for Sprint 148 "reserve_for" debt entries in `.brain/exports/debt.md`
5. Search event log `.deckent/sprint-15*-metrics.jsonl` for detector triggers in last 5 sprints
6. Check NOTIFY adapter integration — `src/core/notify-adapters/` or Sprint 150A H6/H7 evidence
7. Write report to `docs/audits/sprint-152/T-152-012-nervous-11-detectors.md`

## Output
- `docs/audits/sprint-152/T-152-012-nervous-11-detectors.md`
- 11 detector × status table with last trigger date
- Pass/Fail/Missing/Reserved classification

## Rules
- NO source code changes. Only audit report file.
- Scope: `docs/audits/sprint-152/` write-only.
- Evidence: every finding backed by file:line or grep output.
